// Chapter 6: a palette. The sixteen colors of the Commodore 64, in the values known as "Pepto".
// One color on each line: two hexadecimal digits for red, two for green, two for blue.
000000    //  0: black
FFFFFF    //  1: white
68372B    //  2: red
70A4B2    //  3: cyan
6F3D86    //  4: purple
588D43    //  5: green
352879    //  6: blue
B8C76F    //  7: yellow
6F4F25    //  8: orange
433900    //  9: brown
9A6759    // 10: light red
444444    // 11: dark gray
6C6C6C    // 12: gray
9AD284    // 13: light green
6C5EB5    // 14: light blue
959595    // 15: light gray
